<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">One-line Description:</font>=
</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">An issue has been identif=
ied when installing OpenLAB CDS directly from USB install media. The instal=
lation stalls at .NET Framework 4.5 install and will not proceed.</font></p=
re><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">On PCs that do not have M=
icrosoft .NET framework 4.5 or later installed, when you run setup.exe dire=
ctly from the USB install media, the installer will start installing .NET F=
ramework 4.5 and will try to write some of the components on the install me=
dia. Since the install media is read-only, writing the media is not possibl=
e and as a result the install is stalled.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">To avoid this, copy the e=
