</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">When acquiring data, seve=
ral files are copied into the result set folder. If one of these files exce=
eds the limit of 247 characters, it will cause issues with storing the data=
.

Before running a sequence in Acquisition, the maximal length of the result =
set name is  calculated as:=20
Projectpath + result set name + ".rslt" + result set name + ".acaml"

The maximal length (total path including file name) to must be lower than 2=
47 characters. If it is higher, the run cannot be started.=20

This verification does not take into account the long file names for report=
 template and acquisition method, which can cause the result set to not be =
created correctly.


</font></pre><p></p>
