b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Only use peaks from a sin=
gle signal for quantification with timed groups</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This issue is fixed in fo=
llowing versions:
OpenLab CDS v2.5
OpenLab CDS v2.4 Update 08
OpenLab CDS v2.3 Update 12</font></pre><p></p>




