</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">The issue is fixed in CDS=
 2.4 Update 10 and CDS 2.5 update 05.=20
The fix will also be in CDS 2.6.=20
At this time there is no fix for CDS 2.3.</font></pre><p></p>




