</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Slow installation of 2.8 =
updates</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Updates may get stuck for=
 about an hour at the OpenLab Shared Services step. You can see entries "As=
sembly Install: Failing with hr=3D80070005 at RemoveDirectoryAndChildren" i=
n the InstallLog. This is caused by shared libraries being locked by runnin=
g services and applications during the upgrade process. </font></pre><p></p=
>
