<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">One-line Description:</font>=
</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">PostgreSQL 11 Update</fon=
t></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">OpenLab CDS 2.6 and OpenL=
ab Server/ECM XT 2.6 can install multiple instances of PostgreSQL 11 depend=
ing on the configuration. The Agilent OpenLab Data Repository component is =
present on every OpenLab CDS 2.6 and OpenLab Server/ECM XT 2.6 system and a=
 PostgreSQL 11.9.1 instance is installed as part of this component. On Open=
Lab CDS 2.6 Workstation Plus systems, OpenLab Server/ECM XT All-in-One serv=
ers where PostgreSQL is selected as the Database Type, and Shared Services =
Servers (connecting to ECM 3.x) where PostgreSQL is selected as the Databas=
e Type, an additional PostgreSQL 11.5 instance is installed.=20

PostgreSQL 11 is now end-of-life and will no longer receive security and bu=
g fixes. PostgreSQL 11.22 is the final release of PostgreSQL and addresses =
a number of known vulnerabilities discovered in early PostgreSQL 11 release=
s. </font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">n/a</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">OpenLab CDS 2.6 Update 14=
 and OpenLab ECM XT 2.6 Update 14 will update all OpenLab-installed Postgre=
SQL 11 instances to PostgreSQL 11.22.</font></pre><p></p>




