br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This is resolved in OpenL=
AB CDS 2.1. When user performs "Complete current run and abort sequence", s=
equence will be aborted after the data acquisition has completed for the al=
ready prepared sample (the overlapped sample).</font></pre><p></p>




