the user's privilege.

The newly launched client doesn't get the notification about the injection =
in progress because of which it doesn't allow Snapshot. If the user waits f=
or the current injection to complete then they can do snapshot after the ne=
xt injection starts.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">n/a</font></pre><p></p>
