Lab CDS 2.7 Workstation Plus systems, OpenLab Server/ECM XT All-in-One serv=
ers where PostgreSQL is selected as the Database Type, and Shared Services =
Servers (connecting to ECM 3.x) where PostgreSQL is selected as the Databas=
e Type, an additional PostgreSQL 14.1 instance is installed. </font></pre><=
p></p>
