</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Deleting files on upgrade=
d systems may lead to unforeseen data loss</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">On OpenLab CDS 2.8 Workst=
