om an older version, it is possible that deleting one file via the Content =
Browser may lead to the loss of data for other files that were copies of th=
e deleted file.  New installations of OpenLab CDS 2.8 Workstation Plus and =
OpenLab Server/ECM XT 2.8 systems that were not upgraded from an older vers=
ion are not affected by this issue. </font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
