ds that users do not delete any files on upgraded OpenLab CDS 2.8 Workstati=
on Plus and OpenLab Server/ECM XT 2.8 systems until further notice. If it i=
s still available, please retain a full backup of the upgraded 2.8 system i=
mmediately after the upgrade. Otherwise, please retain the most recent full=
 backup of the upgraded 2.8 system.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This issue is fixed in Op=
enLab CDS 2.8 Update 06 and OpenLab Server 2.8 Update 06.</font></pre><p></=
p>




