</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">OpenLab CDS and ECM XT 2.=
6 and 2.7 have the Apache HTTP Server (also referred to as Reverse Proxy) i=
ntegrated. Depending on the exact Apache version installed, 3rd party secur=
ity software reports a list of security vulnerabilities, see https://httpd.=
apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html for details.  </font></pre><p><=
/p>
