br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">OpenLab Reverse Proxy Upd=
ate 06 contains Apache Reverse Proxy 2.4.65 and supersedes OpenLab Reverse =
Proxy Update 05.
OpenLab Reverse Proxy Update 05 contains Apache Reverse Proxy 2.4.62 and su=
persedes OpenLab Reverse Proxy Update 04.
OpenLab Reverse Proxy Update 04 contains Apache Reverse Proxy 2.4.59 and su=
persedes OpenLab Reverse Proxy Update 03.
OpenLab Reverse Proxy Update 03 contains Apache Reverse Proxy 2.4.58 and fi=
xes all Apache vulnerabilities up to release 2.4.57. =20

The mentioned updates are available on SubscribeNet and can be applied to C=
DS and ECM XT 2.6 and 2.7. =20

For OpenLab CDS and ECM XT v2.8 the issue was resolved. =20

</font></pre><p></p>




