For more information, refer to the Help topic =E2=80=9CSelect the ChemStati=
on or EZChrom integrator=E2=80=9D. This is also mentioned in the ChemStatio=
n to OpenLab CDS Migration guide (MigrationGuide_OpenLABCDSChemStnToCDS2.3.=
