</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Data Analysis is slow to =
open with projects that have many folders</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">When a project has many f=
olders, Data Analysis takes some time to open and list all the folders. Wit=
h a couple hundred, this can be more than a minute. With a thousand, it can=
