 times the width at half height of the peak.
In OpenLab CDS the value of h is observed over a distance equal to twenty t=
imes the width at half- height of the peak.
</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">n/a</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This will be improved in =
a future release.</font></pre><p></p>




