</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Adding compounds to metho=
d from SIM data when signal alignment is enabled can cause Data Analysis to=
 crash</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Adding a compound to the =
compound table from SIM data while signal alignment is enabled can cause Da=
ta Analysis to crash under certain conditions.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Do not use signal alignme=
