, the MS metadata needed by ChemStation to properly identify data attribute=
s such as polarity and acquisition time zone is not generated.

One consequence of this is that LCMS data which has been exported to ChemSt=
ation format cannot be re-imported to OpenLab CDS.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">ChemStation will prompt t=
