cuted.  Otherwise, there is no known workaround. =20

This workflow (export LCMS data to ChemStation format, then reimport that e=
xported data into OpenLab CDS) is not supported; this should not be used as=
 a data backup procedure.  Data which is intended for re-import into OpenLa=
b CDS should be exported as an OLAX.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">n/a</font></pre><p></p>




