</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Last modified date of Cal=
ibration Curve on report does not match Last Calibration Date in Processing=
 method</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">In OpenLab CDS v2.6, v2.7=
, and v2.8, the reporting field CalibCurve_LastModifiedDate does not report=
 the true last calibration date if reprocessing without updating the calibr=
ation curve has been performed after the last calibration modification.  Th=
e last calibration date reported by the processing method is correct.</font=
></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Modify the report to retu=
rn the calibration last modified date from the processing method, rather th=
an using the CalibCurve_LastModifiedDate field, if runs are routinely repro=
cessed without updating the calibration curve (for example, if the result s=
et has no calibration standards in it).</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This issue is resolved in=
 OpenLab CDS v2.8 Update 08 with Feature Pack 02.</font></pre><p></p>




