<p><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Keyword:&nbsp;Report Template D=
esign</font></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">One-line Description:</font>=
</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Migration of ChemStation =
Report template to OpenLab CDS v2.x</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">In ChemStation, there are=
 fields specific to the Chromatographic Data System backend Integration. Fo=
r example OpenLab ECM 3.x  information such as:

 - Storage operator
