</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This issue occurs with sp=
ecific user workflow as described above.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Fixed in OpenLab CDS v2.6=
.</font></pre><p></p>




