</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">"Template version" is nam=
ed "Template Version of content management" in report template document</fo=
nt></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">The template version show=
