b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">OpenLab Content Managemen=
t version number can be ignored for all OpenLab CDS related purposes.</font=
></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This issue is fixed in Op=
enLab CDS v2.7.
Correct wording ("Template Version") will be used.</font></pre><p></p>




<hr>
