* Added Wash Cycles with value &lt;value&gt;
* Deleted Wash Time with value 3 s
* Changed Needle Wash Location from Flush Port to Wash Vial
=20
The entry for Deleted Wash Time refers to the wash time in the Flush Port m=
ode which does not apply to the Wash Vial mode. Since this value does not a=
pply, it is deleted from the method.</font></pre><p></p>
