l, the Wash Time value no longer applies and is deleted from the method. Re=
fer to the Wash Needle topic in the OpenLab Help &amp; Learning documentati=
on.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">No fix planned.</font></p=
re><p></p>




