<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This issue is fixed in Op=
enLab Server v2.5 and OpenLab ECM XT v2.5

This fix is also available in the following Software Updates: =20
- OpenLabCDS v2.4 Update 04  and ECM XT 2.4 Update 01
- OpenLab CDS v2.3 Update 10  and ECM XT 2.3 Update 03
- OpenLan CDS v2.2 Update 07 and ECM XT 2.2 Update 01</font></pre><p></p>




